# Title: WinRAR Execution in Non-Standard Folder
# ID: 4ede543c-e098-43d9-a28f-dd784a13132f
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Tigzy
# Date: 2021-11-17
# Tags: attack.collection, attack.t1560.001
# Description: Detects a suspicious WinRAR execution in a folder which is not the default installation folder
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process.executable:*\\rar.exe OR process.executable:*\\winrar.exe)) OR ((Description:"Command line RAR" OR Description:"WinRAR"))) AND NOT ((((process.executable:*:\\Program Files (x86)\\WinRAR\\* OR process.executable:*:\\Program Files\\WinRAR\\*)) OR (process.executable:*\\UnRAR.exe))) AND NOT ((process.executable:*:\\Windows\\Temp\\*)))
